ullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_CrossTenantActorRejects|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ExpiredChallengeRejects|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ReplayAndConcurrentDoubleSubmitExactlyOneSuccess|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ForgedArtifactProofRefRejects|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ChallengeRejectsComparisonProofWithMissingTrustKeys|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ChallengeRejectsComparisonProofWithExplicitFalseTrust|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ChallengeRejectsUnknownComparisonProviderForgingTrustKeys|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_ServerOwnedLocalPngComparisonMetadataSurvivesInternalEvaluation|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_RecordFlagsFalseAndNoRawPayload|FullyQualifiedName=DesignConversionHumanApprovalTests.DesignConversionHumanApproval_FreshStoreServiceReconstructionReadsApprovalAndRejectsReusedChallengeOp</TestCaseFilter>
